      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases of in-stent restenosis of a coronary artery bypass vein graft following beta (beta) brachytheraphy are presented. Previously unreported histopathology of directed atherectomy specimens of such restenotic lesions and a discussion of their proposed significance form the basis of this report."},
